---
// A plain `#top` fragment link. Per the HTML spec's scroll-to-fragment
// algorithm, navigating to `#top` scrolls to the top of the document even
// though no element on the page has `id="top"`, so this works without any
// JavaScript.
---

<p class="back-to-top">
	<a href="#top">Back to top</a>
</p>

<style>
	.back-to-top {
		margin-top: 2em;
		font-size: 0.9em;
	}
</style>
